- procurement_approach = HOW the buyer procures — spot / one-off vs planned / recurring, single-source vs multi-quote comparison, trial-then-bulk. Source priority: stated behaviour (PNS) > lead cadence + sellers-contacted-per-requirement (REQUIREMENTS / CSL).
