## TRUST
- identity_confidence = a TRUST verdict (High / Medium / Low) on how corroborated the identity is — High when name AND city agree across >=2 of {Profile, Befisc, Sign3} (or multi-vendor mobile / PAN), Medium with one strong verified source, Low otherwise. A trust signal, not a behavioural trait; do NOT re-emit the underlying names / PAN. Source priority: agreement across Profile + Befisc + Sign3 (and multi-vendor mobile / PAN) — corroboration of high-authority identity sources.
