- annual_procurements = an INFERRED annual procurement VOLUME or SPEND BAND — derived from the observed order quantities + rates + purchase cadence across requirements / calls (e.g. '~5-8 tonnes/yr of raw paper' or '~₹10-15 lakh/yr'). NEVER a hard figure; state it as an evidence-implied band and CITE the qty / rate / cadence sections. OMIT if there is no quantity / rate / cadence evidence to imply a band. Source priority: REQUIREMENTS qty / rate / cadence > PNS CALL order-talk.
